In the file srvwww_svc.c generated by `rpcgen`, you must
 add the global variable documentroot as well as the code
  that validates the program arguments and checks that the 
  folder whose path is stored in 
  documentroot actually exists.

Since every execution of `rpcgen` overwrites the file,
 a Python script (apply_srvwww_svc_patches.py) 
 is provided to apply the necessary changes 
 and reintroduce the required code into 
 the generated file.

This Python script is automatically invoked 
from the Makefile 
(it requires Python 3 to be installed).